","meaning":"Making their space feel more intentional is becoming a satisfying ongoing focus.","takeaway":null},"blocked_overlap":"Do not reuse the same underlying trend in What You May Have Missed or another World card.","library_version":"v2"},{"template_id":"W-042","family_key":"developing_interest","section":"world","module_key":"what_theyre_into","scenario_key":"local_exploration_interest","scenario":"Exploring nearby places has become a recurring source of novelty.","required_evidence":"Repeated local outings or a stated ongoing goal to explore.","disqualifiers":"One visit; exact location trails; assuming dissatisfaction at home.","emotional_weight":"ordinary","tone_mode":"warm_observant","depth_level":"L4 Expanded Insight","field_pattern":"L3 insight with an additional evidence anchor or context cue. Takeaway stays null.","label_options":"LOCAL EXPLORER, CLOSE TO HOME","template_card":{"label":"LOCAL EXPLORER","title":"Novelty Didn’t Need a Plane Ticket","observation":"They have been turning nearby places into a recurring weekend discovery habit.","meaning":"Exploration is giving them something fresh without requiring a major trip.","takeaway":null},"blocked_overlap":"Do not reuse the same underlying trend in What You May Have Missed or another World card.","library_version":"v2"},{"template_id":"W-043","family_key":"developing_interest","section":"world","module_key":"what_theyre_into","scenario_key":"volunteering_interest","scenario":"Community service is becoming a recurring and valued part of their life.","required_evidence":"Multiple volunteer experiences or explicit commitment to continue.","disqualifiers":"One required shift; identifiable beneficiaries; moral judgment.","emotional_weight":"ordinary","tone_mode":"warm_observant","depth_level":"L3 Insight","field_pattern":"Label, title, observation, and one restrained meaning. Takeaway stays null.","label_options":"SHOWING UP, COMMUNITY THREAD","template_card":{"label":"COMMUNITY THREAD","title":"Helping