onal evidence anchor or context cue. Takeaway stays null.","label_options":"COLLECTION GROWING, CURRENT FIXATION","template_card":{"label":"CURRENT FIXATION","title":"Tiny Details Keep Pulling Them In","observation":"They have been steadily collecting and learning the stories behind small objects.","meaning":"The interest combines discovery, history, and the satisfaction of keeping meaningful details together.","takeaway":null},"blocked_overlap":"Do not reuse the same underlying trend in What You May Have Missed or another World card.","library_version":"v2"},{"template_id":"W-046","family_key":"priority_and_outlook","section":"world","module_key":"recent_vibe","scenario_key":"protecting_rest_priority","scenario":"Rest has become an explicit current priority after overextension.","required_evidence":"Repeated choices protecting rest or a direct statement of current importance.","disqualifiers":"One nap; health advice; assuming disengagement.","emotional_weight":"ordinary","tone_mode":"warm_observant","depth_level":"L3 Insight","field_pattern":"Label, title, observation, and one restrained meaning. Takeaway stays null.","label_options":"REST FIRST, PROTECTING ENERGY","template_card":{"label":"REST FIRST","title":"Recovery Has Made the Calendar","observation":"They have started protecting rest with the same intention they usually give other commitments.","meaning":"Energy is becoming something they plan around, not something they expect to appear.","takeaway":null},"blocked_overlap":"Do not reuse the same underlying trend in What You May Have Missed or another World card.","library_version":"v2"},{"template_id":"W-047","family_key":"priority_and_outlook","section":"world","module_key":"recent_vibe","scenario_key":"learning_priority","scenario":"Learning and growth are a clear ongoing priority across activities.","required_evidence":"Multiple learning behaviors or explicit stated priority over time.","disqualifiers":"One tutorial; superiority or productivity judgment."